I started this project three weeks before the announcement of Dandy's World 1.0 (I was working on the project while the game was still alpha). The idea behind this site was to provide a quick way to access character and trinket information without having to open the game (or if you're in the middle of a run), with a UI design inspired by Dandy's. Now that the game has left alpha and contains much, but much more information than I expected, this project requires significant changes and refactoring, and I am not willing to dedicate the necessary time to it. Besides, the current Research and Stats information is worth seeing in-game, and you can now see your Toon stats in the middle of your run, so this website has kind of lost its purpose. The Dandy's World Fandom Wikipedia is still there, with much more information than this website could have provided. Despite all that, I really enjoyed building this project and learnt a lot from it.

If you would like to see what could have been Dandy Explorer, follow the link in the description below, or build the React project from source! Just do 'npm install' and 'npm run dev' on the root (assuming you have Node.js installed).

https://dandy-explorer.zcesarrr-tw.workers.dev/
